hi Kim,
 You could fit a species group effect by organizing your data so that different species appear as different transects, and then create dummy variables that allocate transects into groups.
 e.g., if you have 10 species worth of data on 5 transects, organize that so that it looks like 50 transects. The species you want to have a shared detection parameter, make up a "siteCov" that indicates which 'transects' share those species.

regards
andy

