Subject: Re: temporally specific predictions across siteCovs in pcountOPEN
Message-ID: <K_t4MZ7V-mY.mEmLFgP1hfIJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <K_t4MZ7V-mY.BcBnyEepjxgJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
References: <K_t4MZ7V-mY.BcBnyEepjxgJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
